WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.386 --> 00:00:03.502
Unit eleven. Helping a Friend Who Is Struggling!

2
00:00:04.497 --> 00:00:07.899
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.949 --> 00:00:11.025
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.075 --> 00:00:15.257
Today we learn about Helping a Friend Who Is Struggling. Let's go!

5
00:00:16.137 --> 00:00:19.154
Listen. Say it with me. Listen!

6
00:00:22.624 --> 00:00:26.674
Warning signs. Say it with me. Warning signs!

7
00:00:30.148 --> 00:00:33.914
Trusted adult. Say it with me. Trusted adult!

8
00:00:37.432 --> 00:00:40.666
Counselor. Say it with me. Counselor!

9
00:00:44.167 --> 00:00:47.601
Support. Say it with me. Support!

10
00:00:51.092 --> 00:00:54.359
Secret. Say it with me. Secret!

11
00:00:57.855 --> 00:01:01.204
Safety. Say it with me. Safety!

12
00:01:04.721 --> 00:01:07.521
Care. Say it with me. Care!

13
00:01:11.075 --> 00:01:22.674
If a friend is struggling, listen without judging and show care. If you notice warning signs or they talk about harming themselves, do not keep it a secret — tell a trusted adult or counselor right away. Their safety comes first.

14
00:01:22.724 --> 00:01:25.340
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:26.839 --> 00:01:31.768
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:31.818 --> 00:01:33.005
Trusted adult!

17
00:01:34.138 --> 00:01:39.243
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:39.293 --> 00:01:40.443
Safety!

19
00:01:41.388 --> 00:01:48.397
Did you know? You do not need to have all the answers — connecting a friend with a trusted adult is a powerful way to help!

20
00:01:48.447 --> 00:01:50.280
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:50.979 --> 00:01:59.642
Think and answer. Why should you tell an adult even if a friend asks you to keep it secret?

22
00:01:59.692 --> 00:02:00.842
Great answer!

23
00:02:01.896 --> 00:02:06.537
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:06.587 --> 00:02:09.068
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

